<title>NETHERLANDS: Van Leer 1996 net profit NLG 96.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Van Leer 1996 net profit NLG 96.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     3.22 vs   2.31</p>
<p>    Net profit			    96.9  vs  79.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  1.00 vs   0.78</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  4.18 vs   3.98</p>
<p>    Gross operating result	   225.1  vs 200.6</p>
<p>    Extraordinary charges		3.7  vs   1.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Royal Packaging Industries Van Leer NV previously said it expected 1996 full-year profit growth to match the 23 percent posted in the first half.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
